            <div xml:id="d341">

                <pb facs="0451" n="441" sameAs="frus:frus1948v07/pg441"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/8–3048: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Peiping</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Touchette</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-08-30">August 30,
                        1948</date>.<lb/>[Received August 30—4:52 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>323. Re mytel 322, August 28. Seventy-three students now being held in jail
                    pending trial. Twenty-one others have been released on bail.</p>
                <p>Sent Nanking 477; repeated Department 323.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Touchette</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
